{"slug":"dj-mustard-fat-joe-drake-urge-druski-2-funny-sign-inmate-rapper-to-label-watch","postId":74350,"title":"DJ Mustard, Fat Joe, Drake Urge Druski 2 Funny Sign Inmate Rapper To Label [Watch]","htmlContent":"<!-- wp:image {\"id\":514190,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img src=\"http://landonbuford.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/12/131538556_809357486301957_7054721960691367797_n.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-514190\"/><figcaption>Instagram </figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>On Friday night, Druski2funny [Druski] was on Instagram Live promoting his new clothes dropping on  Druski2funny.com, and he also allowed guests to tap in and rap for him as a possibility of him signing them. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>When Druski allowed some inmates to hop on his Instagram Live, it started off peacefully as Druski was warned not to do no funny s***, which he admitted he was scared of them. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WG8F2UpGK-Yu0026ab_channel=Wockanda\",\"type\":\"video\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"youtube\",\"responsive\":true,\"className\":\"wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WG8F2UpGK-Y&amp;ab_channel=Wockanda\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A rapper named Budda begins rapping/ singing a song called 'Do You Love Me.' </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Drake, Chance the Rapper, DJ Mustard, and Fat Joe were in the comment section showing their support during the performance and telling Druski to sign him Immediately. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>DJ Mustard said to sign him and \"take all of the publishing.\"</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Fat Joe said, 'Sign him now.\"</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>After things went left, Drake said, 'Just signed your death warrant.\" </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":514187,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://landonbuford.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/12/268456640_727298268242223_635028856737367083_n-632x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-514187\"/><figcaption><br>Chance the Rapper follows that up with, \"U was scared fr [for real].\"<br><br><gwmw style=\"display:none;\"><gwmw style=\"display:none;\"></figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":514188,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://landonbuford.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/12/268445636_1095172801245885_3931421601747557952_n-578x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-514188\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Budda gets out in March of 2022, which Druski would take note of, but he might be banned from Atlanta.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>\"Where the money at Druski? </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Ey hold on, man, we ain't sign him yet!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>What year do you get out, man? </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Man, I get out March 7, 2022 </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Real Atlanta in the building! East Atlanta Zone three, Westside. Keep playing n*** we going to catch you in the Westend. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>And later, Druski admitted that they had him shook, but the single he was singing was catchy!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->","excerpt":"Instagram On Friday night, Druski2funny [Druski] was on Instagram Live promoting his new clothes dropping on Druski2funny.com, and he also allowed guests to tap in and rap for him as a possibility…","publishedAt":"2021-12-26T06:00:00Z","modifiedAt":"2021-12-26T06:00:00Z","author":{"slug":"tony-mcknight","displayName":"Tony McKnight"},"categories":[{"slug":"uncategorized","name":"Uncategorized"}],"tags":[{"slug":"byron-nelson","name":"Byron Nelson"},{"slug":"chance-the-rapper","name":"Chance The Rapper"},{"slug":"dj-mustard","name":"DJ Mustard"},{"slug":"drake","name":"Drake"},{"slug":"entertainment-news","name":"Entertainment news"},{"slug":"fat-joe","name":"Fat Joe"},{"slug":"instagram-live","name":"Instagram Live"}],"heroImage":{"originalUrl":"http://landonbuford.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/12/131538556_809357486301957_7054721960691367797_n.jpg"},"inlineImageUrls":["http://landonbuford.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/12/131538556_809357486301957_7054721960691367797_n.jpg","http://landonbuford.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/12/268456640_727298268242223_635028856737367083_n-632x1024.jpg","http://landonbuford.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/12/268445636_1095172801245885_3931421601747557952_n-578x1024.jpg"],"readingTimeMin":1,"type":"post","link":"https://landonbuford.com/dj-mustard-fat-joe-drake-urge-druski-2-funny-sign-inmate-rapper-to-label-watch/"}